  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">SSC MTS &amp; Havaldar 2024 Final Answer Key</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-03-26T18:24:30+05:30\">March 26, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">6:24 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>The Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</strong></a> has released <strong>Final Answer Key Havaldar </strong>on official website for the recruitment of<strong> SSC MTS Post.</strong> This recruitment is for <strong>11518 positions.</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>SSC Exam </strong>will be Conducted From\u00a0<strong>05-12 February 2025.</strong> The last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong>03rd August 2024.</strong> and can be checked their <strong>Answer Key</strong> through <strong>Enrollment number</strong>\u00a0/\u00a0<strong>Registration number</strong>\u00a0/\u00a0<strong>Date of birth</strong>\u00a0by login into the portal. Which has given below.\u00a0</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">SSC MTS &amp; Havaldar 2024 Final Answer Key \u2013 Out</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">SSC MTS Examination 2024 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-mts-havaldar-2024-final-answer-key/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Dates: <strong>September 30, 2024,</strong> to <strong>November 14, 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Release Date: <strong>September 20, 2024 (Region-wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key Release Date: <strong>29-Nov-2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>12\u00a0March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Final Answer Key Date : 26 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>General, OBC, and EWS candidates</strong>: \u20b9100</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SC, ST, PWD, Ex-Servicemen, and Female candidates</strong>: Exempted from payment</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The fee can be paid through various online modes, including:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Cards</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Cards</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">BHIM UPI</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Age Limits As On</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Eligibility Age Limit for<strong> SSC MTS 2024</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>18 to 25 Years:</strong> For most posts under <strong>SSC MTS.</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>18 to 27 Years:</strong> For specific posts, as notified by <strong>SSC.<br/>\n</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Age Relaxation for Reserved Categories.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>The following age relaxations are applicable as per government norms:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC/ST: <strong>+5 years</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">OBC: <strong>+3 years</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PwD (Unreserved): <strong>+10 years</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PwD (OBC): <strong>+13 years</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PwD (SC/ST): <strong>+15 years<br/>\n</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Other categories like <strong>ex-servicemen and central government employees</strong> may also receive relaxations as per <strong>SSC guidelines</strong>.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">11518 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>