nswer Key 2024 : Details</h6>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #003366; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Eligibility for Checking Answer Key :\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates who successfully appeared for the SSC MTS or Havaldar examination can check their answer key by the login section through the registration number/enrollment number mentioned on their admit card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #003366; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Steps to Check &amp; Download SSC MTS &amp; Havaldar 2024 Final Answer Key\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"\" data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"74\">\n<p class=\"\" data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"77\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-end=\"107\" data-start=\"77\">Visit the Official Website</strong>: Go to the <strong data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"119\">SSC official website</strong> \u2013 <a data-end=\"186\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"146\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">https://ssc.nic.in</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-end=\"321\" data-start=\"190\">\n<p class=\"\" data-end=\"321\" data-start=\"193\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"193\">Find the Notification</strong>: Click on the link for <strong data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"242\">\u201cSSC MTS &amp; Havaldar 2024 Final Answer Key\u201d</strong> in the latest updates section.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"322\">\n<p class=\"\" d